--- !u!114 &5356174261458916489
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6267733536039317360}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9e7250556d00d84840dc85e6ae57d36d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_name: 
  m_priceToActivate: 0
  m_isSingleUse: 0
  m_isContinuesActivation: 0
  m_isCanBeUsedToActivate: 1
  m_isCanBeTouchedToActivate: 0
  m_isCanBeShotToActivate: 0
  m_isCanBeActivatedByNPC: 0
  m_isShowOutline: 0
  m_isHideNotificationInteract: 0
  m_isObstructionPaths: 0
  m_isUnInteractable: 0
  m_objectsToEnableAfterActivation: []
  m_objectsToDisableAfterActivation: []
  m_spawnersToEnableAfterActivation: []
  m_interactablesToActivateAfterActivation: []
  m_text: 'Dear Subject,


    Welcome to your new home. I hope my people did not
    hurt you too badly while we escorted you to this location. Your cuts and bruises
    will heal soon enough.


    You must be confused and wondering where you are
    and why you are here. As of right now, we cannot give you the full explanation.
    In time, however, as you prove yourself to be worthy, we will clue you in and
    maybe even release you again to the public world.


    Please don''t be afraid.
    We are not here to harm you. All we want from you is data. We will be exposing
    you to a couple of situations in order to see what your reactions are. You will
    be put in hostile situations, and you will have to defend yourself from dangerous
    entities. We will provide you with weapons and medicinal aid at these locations.


    On
    your right there is a terminal. There are 3 tabs on the screen: "Locations",
    "Experiments" and "Data".


    On the first tab titled "Locations" there are
    a couple of locations listed. You can decide which location you want to try out.
    Pick any one you like. I suggest to start with "Shack", as you are new to this
    and this location is (relatively) less hostile than others. If you are in serious
    danger of dying (or other things) however, we will rescue you and return you
    back to your room.


    On the second tab titled "Experiments" is listed all
    the experiments we want you to perform. Look over these experiments, and execute
    them at the corresponding locations. This is your mission. These experiments
    are what you have to do in order to be free again. Don''t fail us.


    On the
    third and last tab titled "Data" you can see some data we have collected from
    you during your experiences at the hostile locations. We thought it would be
    interesting for you to review your own experiences and to also learn from your
    mistakes.


    This is it. Start your new life and make us proud!


    - SIT


    (PS:
    we stashed the clothes you were wearing during your capture in the Wardrobe.
    It''s the big wooden closet to your right. You can acces it to wear your clothes
    or any other clothes you might find in the future)

    (PPS: you will receive
    food and water only when you return from locations, so get going)'
  m_fontSize: 0
